OL,3,GNEWSAControversial historic market
OL,4,Aplans given go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans for a multi-million
OL,7,Fpound market redevelopment have been
OL,8,Fapproved, despite the concerns of
OL,9,Ftraders.
OL,11,FThose behind the proposals for
OL,12,FCambridge's market square hope it will
OL,13,Fhave a mix of permanent and removable
OL,14,Fstalls, enabling events to be held, and
OL,15,Fclaim its current cobbled surface is
OL,16,Fslippery when wet.
OL,18,FBut some stallholders told the BBC they
OL,19,Ffear for the future, with one stating
OL,20,Fmost of the current traders "will be
OL,21,Fgone" if the plans went through.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
